IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DEJAVU-SPARSITY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ACTIVE-CHANNELS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-SAVED-PCT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DEJAVU.
    IF HIDDEN-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT == 0
        MOVE 60 TO SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT.
    END-IF.

    # R2 = (HIDDEN-DIM * (100 - SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT)) / 100
    MOVE 100 TO R14.
    SUBTRACT SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT FROM R14.
    MOVE HIDDEN-DIM TO ACTIVE-CHANNELS.
    MULTIPLY R14 BY ACTIVE-CHANNELS.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO ACTIVE-CHANNELS.
    IF ACTIVE-CHANNELS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO ACTIVE-CHANNELS.
    END-IF.

    # R3 = (SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT * 85) / 100
    MOVE SPARSITY-TARGET-PCT TO LATENCY-SAVED-PCT.
    MULTIPLY 85 BY LATENCY-SAVED-PCT.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO LATENCY-SAVED-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-CHANNELS.
    WEIGHT 30 LATENCY-SAVED-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
